WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.929
Four tests cover this chapter:
the intervals and the summary,

2
00:00:03.929 --> 00:00:08.040
every rule on the fixture, a failed
audit record that isn't a block,

3
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.988
and a cancelled separation
that isn't flagged.

4
00:00:10.988 --> 00:00:16.783
With the other chapters' tests, fifty-seven
pass under Python 3.10 or later,

5
00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.488
with no package, tenant or network.

6
00:00:19.488 --> 00:00:21.938
Remember that the code is illustrative.

7
00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:25.136
It runs against fictional
leavers and exports,

8
00:00:25.136 --> 00:00:30.020
so review it and run Lab 2 in a test
tenant before it reports a real leaver.
